    <summary>Official compiler and CLI for the Alya programming language</summary>
    <description><![CDATA[
# Alya Programming Language

Alya is a simple, intuitive, and modern multi-platform compiled programming language.

## Key Features
- **Native Assembly Codegen:** Directly compiles to native GNU assembly and coordinates with minimal toolchains.
- **Zero-Setup Toolchain Resolver:** Automatically downloads and configures a minimal GCC/MinGW toolchain on Windows if not present.
- **Built-in Package Manager & REPL:** Built-in tools (`alyac add`, `alyac test`, `alyac fmt`, `alyac repl`).
- **Offline & Standalone Ready:** Works seamlessly without external runtime dependencies.
]]></description>
